const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究2017年繁荣期稳定币发行、链上流动和交易所比特币价格之间的关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper studies relations among stablecoin issuance, on-chain flows, and exchange Bitcoin prices during the 2017 boom. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源使用链上流动识别和交易所价格时间序列，对不同关于稳定币流动的解释进行比较。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses on-chain flow identification and exchange price series to compare explanations for stablecoin-related liquidity. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要钱包或地址映射、发行事件、链上转移、场所级价格、时间戳、交易所身份和原始数据覆盖说明。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Use wallet or address mappings, issuance events, on-chain transfers, venue prices, timestamps, exchange identity, and original coverage notes. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要报告与供给驱动假说一致的模式；它不把观察到的时间关系升级为对当前储备、全部稳定币或整个加密市场的证明。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract reports patterns consistent with a supply-driven hypothesis; it is not proof about current reserves, all stablecoins, or the whole crypto market. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结链上标签和场所范围，审计时间同步与地址归属假设，区分授权、发行和转移，并保留缺失及修订记录。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze chain labels and venue scope; audit clock synchronization and address-attribution assumptions; separate authorization, issuance, and transfer; retain gaps and revisions. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2020)。单一历史周期和受限场所数据不能代表所有加密资产，也不构成关于储备、操纵或价格走向的当前判断。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2020). One historical cycle and restricted venue data do not represent all crypto assets or supply a current judgment on reserves, manipulation, or price direction. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12903",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2020) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Is Bitcoin Really Un-Tethered?”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。单一历史周期和受限场所数据不能代表所有加密资产，也不构成关于储备、操纵或价格走向的当前判断。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Is Bitcoin Really Un-Tethered?”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
